{"id": "DfbQXJ3SuK3", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Diwali par dhol bajakar ghar se kise nikala jaata hai?\n\nMuni Uddalak Alakshmi ko peepal ke neeche bitha kar gaye, aur kabhi nahi laute. Unka rona Vaikunth tak pahuncha. Bhagwan Vishnu ne vachan diya ki jo roz unki pooja karega, uske ghar se Lakshmi kabhi nahi jayengi.\n\nAur isi Padma Purana mein Bhagwan Shiv kehte hain ki Diwali ki aadhi raat ke baad striyan dhol bajakar unhe aangan se bahar nikalti hain.\n\nPart 2 of 2. Sources pinned comment mein hain.\n\nAapke ghar mein yeh reet hoti hai? 👇\n\n#diwali #lakshmipuja #alakshmi #lakshmipujan #sanatandharma", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1794023600, "like_count": 27900, "comment_count": 69, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1493361045944583a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 58.806, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQO6z90jqoJUDEg22FESkQWFpsUcWUpoH7KqprFcC9_rvAU3S2w0Q5CFIxr6XmKEXOryFaHfKd1O-EljKG6lIYIdUsWXdavN896NPu0.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Adp1XTKA835fYfVX_76mkN4_1UlI_5vTkqS0MWgavXeQ9KTifKiQpfrskT1HuLJV0lRLMyfMjUz5M8imAKwUFAGY&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Ikk9fyWAoUMQ7kNvwF5jzcJ&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=_p8cH_2CH4SCKG6R1sTx9w&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTr-_8-3hdQhFV5eZQMXZNG5nFIndpBY0RtcVPbI3mOHg&oe=6AF43265", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 58.806, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5